            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The differential diagnosis of groin pain is broad and complex. Therefore, it is essential to develop an algorithm when differentiating the hip as a cause of groin pain from other sources. Selective injections in and around the hip can be helpful when making the diagnosis but are only one part of the algorithm.</AbstractText>
